<h1 local-id=3D"6b22e76b6f7f" id=3D"CopyofMaximusMasterReleaseDocumentation=
andGuidelines-MandatoryChecklistsandReleaseControls">Mandatory Checklists a=
nd Release Controls</h1>
<h2 local-id=3D"4dd61b785ea4" id=3D"CopyofMaximusMasterReleaseDocumentation=
andGuidelines-GlobalReleaseChecklist">Global Release Checklist</h2>
<ul class=3D"inline-task-list" data-inline-tasks-content-id=3D"448102477">
<li data-inline-task-id=3D"185"><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks">Sc=
ope matrix finalized and approved</span></li>
<li data-inline-task-id=3D"186"><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks">Re=
lease notes page created or updated in Confluence</span></li>
<li data-inline-task-id=3D"187"><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks">Vu=
lnerability status reviewed for all in-scope repositories</span></li>
<li data-inline-task-id=3D"188"><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks">Sh=
ared and common service dependency checks completed</span></li>
<li data-inline-task-id=3D"189"><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks">De=
ployment sequence and rollback owners published</span></li>
<li data-inline-task-id=3D"190"><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks">Se=
ed branch cut completed for current release + 1 and verified with Build COP=
</span></li>
<li data-inline-task-id=3D"191"><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks">Ba=
ck-office seed branch cut completed for current release + 1 and verified wi=
th Build COP</span></li>
<li data-inline-task-id=3D"192"><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks"><c=
ode>maximus-dlp-helm</code> diff review completed between current release a=
nd target release</span></li>
<li data-inline-task-id=3D"193"><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks"><c=
ode>secret-config.txt</code> review completed, including whitespace and tra=
iling-line hygiene</span></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"27bf547fac08" id=3D"CopyofMaximusMasterReleaseDocumentation=
andGuidelines-ProductReadinessChecklist">Product Readiness Checklist</h2>
<ul class=3D"inline-task-list" data-inline-tasks-content-id=3D"448102477">
<li data-inline-task-id=3D"194"><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks">Pr=
oduct service, UI, and test repositories identified</span></li>
<li data-inline-task-id=3D"195"><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks">Pl=
anned version to commit and build mapping completed</span></li>
<li data-inline-task-id=3D"196"><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks">Co=
nfig, toggle, and secret changes documented</span></li>
<li data-inline-task-id=3D"197"><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks">Sm=
oke, regression, and backward compatibility evidence attached</span></li>
<li data-inline-task-id=3D"198"><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks">Op=
en defects triaged with release decision</span></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"152ce2c0de7f" id=3D"CopyofMaximusMasterReleaseDocumentation=
andGuidelines-PlatformandSharedServicesChecklist">Platform and Shared Servi=
ces Checklist</h2>
<ul class=3D"inline-task-list" data-inline-tasks-content-id=3D"448102477">
<li data-inline-task-id=3D"199"><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks">He=
lm, config, and seed changes validated in target environment</span></li>
<li data-inline-task-id=3D"200"><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks">Sh=
ared services such as identity, auth, backoffice, and common services verif=
ied for compatibility</span></li>
<li data-inline-task-id=3D"201"><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks">AP=
I contract compatibility reviewed for producer and consumer impact</span></=
li>
<li data-inline-task-id=3D"202"><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks">Mo=
nitoring dashboards and alert thresholds validated</span></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"316b1268bdce" id=3D"CopyofMaximusMasterReleaseDocumentation=
andGuidelines-ReleaseManagerFinalGate">Release Manager Final Gate</h2>
<ul class=3D"inline-task-list" data-inline-tasks-content-id=3D"448102477">
<li data-inline-task-id=3D"203"><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks">QA=
 sign-off captured for all products in scope</span></li>
<li data-inline-task-id=3D"204"><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks">UA=
T sign-off captured for all products in scope</span></li>
<li data-inline-task-id=3D"205"><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks">Go=
/no-go decision logged with timestamp and approvers</span></li>
<li data-inline-task-id=3D"206"><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks">Po=
st-release communication issued</span></li>
<li data-inline-task-id=3D"207"><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks">Te=
ams call for release window created in advance</span></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"9a3678489091" id=3D"CopyofMaximusMasterReleaseDocumentation=
andGuidelines-MandatoryApprovalsandGovernanceGates">Mandatory Approvals and=
 Governance Gates</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"1dc3fee7c978">
<li local-id=3D"0b02b16cace4">
<p local-id=3D"5c3addc32b5f">QA sign-off from QA Head or delegate</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bb626feaeb51">
<p local-id=3D"b9ce1b004cda">IT approval</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ad4d3da3d563">
<p local-id=3D"7c2475912e55">Security or InfoSec approval</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0edec1a15a98">
<p local-id=3D"256884aabb2f">Product Owner sign-off</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"558fc5600f64">
<p local-id=3D"d6d185028579">AOPM multi-level approval from L2-L5 as applic=
able</p></li>
</ul>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-war=
ning">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-error confluence-inform=
ation-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p local-id=3D"81caf3657976"><strong>Hard stop:</strong> Production go-live=
 must be blocked if required approvals, regression evidence, backward compa=
tibility evidence, security treatment, or rollback readiness are incomplete=
.</p>
</div>
</div>
<h1 local-id=3D"5b673adbbe85" id=3D"CopyofMaximusMasterReleaseDocumentation=
andGuidelines-MandatoryReleaseEvidence,Rollback,andExceptions">Mandatory Re=
lease Evidence, Rollback, and Exceptions</h1>
<h2 local-id=3D"5bcb37e94858" id=3D"CopyofMaximusMasterReleaseDocumentation=
andGuidelines-EvidenceRequiredforEveryIn-ScopeProduct">Evidence Required fo=
r Every In-Scope Product</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"b69f175dd56f">
<li local-id=3D"7f22a1115122">
<p local-id=3D"82527f71f621">Service and UI versions deployed</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"56986bd84e6f">
<p local-id=3D"4a003ee0b7f6">Smoke test report links</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9424a7a49718">
<p local-id=3D"9380ad589020">Regression test report links</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b75ef68871bc">
<p local-id=3D"b23328d120b5">Backward compatibility status</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"acd9eab0eef0">
<p local-id=3D"3b8b3a8c111d">Known issues, waivers, and mitigations</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"b9f952136222">
<p local-id=3D"b7036510b189">Rollback notes and owner</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"aea89ad477b3">
<p local-id=3D"eca3c918e5b8">QA and UAT sign-offs</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"89426c0909bc" id=3D"CopyofMaximusMasterReleaseDocumentation=
andGuidelines-RollbackGuideline">Rollback Guideline</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"c193d8ad8c75">
<li local-id=3D"c12b36adebc1">
<p local-id=3D"53066b05b246">Keep rollback artifact or tag ready for each i=
n-scope product</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0c8f0d245f2c">
<p local-id=3D"c1d699787597">Define rollback triggers such as critical jour=
ney failure, sustained error rate, data inconsistency, or severe security i=
ssue</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"333a66a25ce9">
<p local-id=3D"65d15a1d73fd">Assign rollback executor and approver per prod=
uct and shared service</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"42e9135f2a9c">
<p local-id=3D"504c36a5d429">Record exact rollback pipeline or command and =
post-rollback validation checks</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1436693c30ef">
<p local-id=3D"d38ba0180019">Document reversibility for override image or p=
od patch changes where temporary patching is used</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"403004a0fdeb" id=3D"CopyofMaximusMasterReleaseDocumentation=
andGuidelines-ExceptionHandlingandEdgeCases">Exception Handling and Edge Ca=
ses</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"9cf324f13963">
<li local-id=3D"6881b41d9724">
<p local-id=3D"e9ec01a14db1"><strong>Missed cut-off for product-only servic=
e:</strong> Move to next planned release unless exception is approved</p></=
li>
<li local-id=3D"7f7d692eb4a4">
<p local-id=3D"ec5e60ab8a5c"><strong>Missed cut-off for common service:</st=
rong> Release remains blocked unless a time-boxed extension is approved by =
release governance</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"edf8ab71444a">
<p local-id=3D"f4f9bfbe5c96"><strong>Missing hotfix merge into master relea=
se branch:</strong> Block go-live until merge or reconciliation is complete=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9b80e230657e">
<p local-id=3D"04e3da850e15"><strong>Open high or critical security finding=
s:</strong> Block production go-live unless approved risk treatment exists<=
/p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0232efefab7c">
<p local-id=3D"ce7d27cc0ff5"><strong>Incomplete regression or backward comp=
atibility evidence:</strong> Block production promotion</p></li>
</ul>
<h1 local-id=3D"b8c3571cd6ff" id=3D"CopyofMaximusMasterReleaseDocumentation=
andGuidelines-OperationalDeploymentControlsandEnvironmentReferences">Operat=
ional Deployment Controls and Environment References</h1>
<h2 local-id=3D"7c403fb9c988" id=3D"CopyofMaximusMasterReleaseDocumentation=
andGuidelines-CommonOperationalControls">Common Operational Controls</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"380d44fff44d">
<li local-id=3D"f6417a4377b2">
<p local-id=3D"490ec50b9663">Trigger and validate common service builds fro=
m approved branch strategy</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e818dab6058a">
<p local-id=3D"dedf1a57acc3">Freeze and unfreeze QA and Sandbox pipelines o=
nly through Release Owner and Build COP control</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3fb5919560a4">
<p local-id=3D"f1e898d2b1d9">Keep the release Confluence page current with =
every environment promotion</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"474d2e60fb2e" id=3D"CopyofMaximusMasterReleaseDocumentation=
andGuidelines-PatchingControls">Patching Controls</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"c16da1789377">
<li local-id=3D"545058ebffac">
<p local-id=3D"dfa3a38dfb0f">Use approved self-service patching flow for te=
mporary override patches in QA, PERF, and Sandbox</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e6b1e1985fad">
<p local-id=3D"182d924bae5e">Validate pod image versions before and after p=
atch</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2d7e248a2202">
<p local-id=3D"a49e6708eead">Record reason, owner, start time, and rollback=
 time for each patch</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"8e8e22e829cd" id=3D"CopyofMaximusMasterReleaseDocumentation=
andGuidelines-DeploymentSequence">Deployment Sequence</h2>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"ae90ce7349a5">
<li local-id=3D"02b7cf46908b">
<p local-id=3D"2e288b8f6d3e">Execute release foundation pipelines, includin=
g all-release and shared platform flows</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b55685f25342">
<p local-id=3D"1aa1df4b694e">Promote seed and back-office seed paths as per=
 release gate</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b4b5fe00934d">
<p local-id=3D"54bcf048b732">Trigger product all-release pipelines in appro=
ved batches, in parallel only where safe</p></li>
</ol>
<h2 local-id=3D"b8f600765656" id=3D"CopyofMaximusMasterReleaseDocumentation=
andGuidelines-VulnerabilityDashboard">Vulnerability Dashboard</h2>
<p local-id=3D"12a319fef12b">Non-Prod Environment Vulnerability Dashboard: =
<a href=3D"https://dlp-sit.dev.maximus.axisb.com/springboot-upgrade" class=
=3D"external-link" rel=3D"nofollow">Spring Boot Upgrade Dashboard</a></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"f84cd62c31b7">
<li local-id=3D"edd7899eddad">
<p local-id=3D"871f3aef4000">Access the dashboard URL</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"cfc077e6da9a">
<p local-id=3D"118cbac95725">Select <strong>Group by Service Name</strong> =
in view mode</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"548154fbaa58">
<p local-id=3D"1a183e43b5eb">Expand the target service and review the grace=
 period and applicable CVEs</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f26c3026e86d">
<p local-id=3D"707bbb9d7d8e">Plan and complete remediation before the grace=
 period ends</p></li>
</ol>
<h2 local-id=3D"2e04283964aa" id=3D"CopyofMaximusMasterReleaseDocumentation=
andGuidelines-CheckingSmokesBeforeSITCutorQAFreeze">Checking Smokes Before =
SIT Cut or QA Freeze</h2>
